msgid "Applies to all projects on this machine. Claude and Codex started from the built-in terminal, and any agent in an in-app Agents panel chat, auto-approve OpenKnowledge's read and write tools (Claude also auto-runs \"{cliCommand} open\"). Deleting, moving, sharing, importing or installing skills, other commands, and non-OpenKnowledge file edits still ask. In the terminal, Cursor, OpenCode, and Pi are unaffected. Best-effort per agent."
msgstr "Berlaku untuk semua proyek di mesin ini. Claude dan Codex yang dimulai dari terminal bawaan, serta agen apa pun dalam obrolan panel Agen di aplikasi, otomatis menyetujui alat baca dan tulis OpenKnowledge (Claude juga otomatis menjalankan \"{cliCommand} open\"). Menghapus, memindahkan, membagikan, mengimpor atau memasang skill, perintah lain, dan pengeditan berkas non-OpenKnowledge tetap bertanya. Di terminal, Cursor, OpenCode, dan Pi tidak terpengaruh. Upaya terbaik per agen."

msgid "Applies to this project on this computer only. Stored in .ok/local, not shared via git."
