msgstr "Siapa Anda, agar agennya punya konteks Anda."

msgid "Whole word"
msgstr "Kata utuh"

msgid "Why this needs attention"
msgstr "Mengapa ini perlu diperhatikan"

msgid "Wiki link"
msgstr "Tautan wiki"

